From b3739d1062489f8649e5e32b13d1ecebc5523862 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: x <a@b>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 01:55:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ss3ds: provide sub_0203A444 (wireless icon teardown) natively

Run 56 two-console Union Room test crashed in native_sub_0203A914 (inlined sub_0203A444): after SysTask_Destroy it hides the
icon sprite by writing DS OAM directly at 0x07000000 / 0x07000400, which is unmapped on the 3DS. Listed in native-provided.json;
platform/ss3ds_dwcstub.c keeps the task destroy and the free, without the raw OAM writes.
---
 port/soulsilver-native-play/maploader/native-provided.json | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/port/soulsilver-native-play/maploader/native-provided.json b/port/soulsilver-native-play/maploader/native-provided.json
index 8e3bd0c..f08b458 100644
--- a/port/soulsilver-native-play/maploader/native-provided.json
+++ b/port/soulsilver-native-play/maploader/native-provided.json
@@ -880,5 +880,6 @@
 "sub_02068FC8",
 "sub_020691A8",
 "sub_020691E8",
-"sub_0203A700"
+"sub_0203A700",
+"sub_0203A444"
 ]
